<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Nat'l Re 6-mth net up 8.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Nat'l Re 6-mth net up 8.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	  33.66   vs	  30.98</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 19.73   vs	  18.15</p>
<p>    Gross premium	    389.92   vs	 321.01</p>
<p>    Net premium		189.46   vs	 155.33</p>
<p>    Operating revenue	206.46   vs	 171.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    48.06   vs	  44.18</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	5.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Malaysia National Reinsurance Bhd is a general insurance underwriter.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
